land acquisition issues & \nencroachment removal but the project has since been completed in \nMarch, 2023 de-scoping Toll Plaza near Bangladesh border. \n(f) No, Sir. \n(g) Does not arise. \n(h) The details of important NH projects completed/ under \nimplementation in North Bengal including Balurghat Parliamentary \nConstituency during last five years are in Annexure-I.  \n   \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n ANNEXURE-I \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (h) OF LOK SABHA \nSTARRED QUESTION NO. 172 ANSWERED ON 14.12.2023 ASKED BY \nDR. SUKANTA MAJUMDARREGARDING FOUR AND SIX LANING OF \nNH-512 \n  \n  \nThe details of important NH projects (costing more than Rs. 50 \nCrores) completed/ under  implementation in North Bengal including \nBalurghat Parliamentary Constituency during last five years are as \nunder: \n  \nSr. \nNo \nName of the Project TPC \n(Rs in \ncrore) \nLength \nin km \nPhysical \nProgress \nActual/ \nTarget \nDate of \ncompletion \n1 Four laning of Ghospukur-\nDhupguri Section of NH -\n31D (Package I) in the \nstate of West Bengal on \nEPC Mode. \n1133.02 83.78 Completed 19-07-2021 \n2 Four laning of Farakka – \nRaiganj Section of NH -34 \nin the State of West \nBengal under NHDP \nPhase-III on DBFOT (Toll) \nbasis. \n1078.84 100.2 Completed 25-03-2022 \n3 Proposed development for \nroad corridor component \nof AH-48 involving NH-717, \nNH-31, NH -31C, NH -317A \non Sub -regional Road \nConnectivity among \nBangladesh, Bhutan, \nIndian & Nepal under the \nloan assistance from ADB. \n(Job No. AH -48-WB-2014-\n15-380) \n937.76 90.57 Completed 01-11-2019 \n4 Proposed development for \nroad corridor component \nof AH -02 involving NH -\n327B, NH -31C, NH -31 & \nNH-10 on Sub -regional \nRoad Connectivity among \n720.97 37.27 Completed 31-07-2019 \n\nSr. \nNo \nName of the Project TPC \n(Rs in \ncrore) \nLength \nin km \nPhysical \nProgress \nActual/ \nTarget \nDate of \ncompletion \nBangladesh, Bhutan, \nIndian & Nepal under the \nloa